From 2fe79397ffeb3fcd396a65d8d59c306ea0871cb0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 23:31:19 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Commit each ordinary transaction into the UTXO store

ConnectOrdinaryBlock takes an optional PersistentUtxoStore. After a
transaction is applied in memory, that transaction's erasures and
created coins are committed alone, so a later transaction can spend
them. An empty erasure-and-create batch is not committed. Rejection
undoes those commits newest first and restores the in-memory parent
even if a store Undo fails. Monetary bytes are not written, and
snapshot.dat is unchanged. This is not lotusd ConnectTip and does not
accept a block.
---
